Z||000000||86SEFIERO||06-03-2000||05:16 AM||||<BR>i HAVE AN 86 FIERO se WITH V-6 2.8 iT CRANKS OVER SEVERAL TIMES BEFORE IT WILL START iUST CHANGED SPARKPLUGS CAP AND ROTOR AND WIRES BUT DIDNT SEEM TO HELP ALOT. iT SEEMS TO RUN ALRIGHT AFTER I GET IT STARTED, EXCEPT FOR IT SEEMS TO HAVE A LITTLE BIT OF AN IRRATIC IDDLE TO IT. wHERE DO I LOOK NEXT?||||reg||1
Z||000001||2birds||06-03-2000||09:06 PM||||Have you ever changed the pickup coil?  That cured my hard starting problem.  Symptoms were the same as yours.||||reg||1
Z||000002||86SEFIERO||06-03-2000||10:21 PM||||wheres the pickup-coil located at||||reg||1
Z||000003||2birds||06-03-2000||10:37 PM||||It's the green corroded thing under the rotor and reluctor wheel inside the distributor cap.  You have to take the distributor apart completely to replace it.  PITA, but well worth the 10-20 bucks and the hour or so to do it right. <BR>Some guys say to change it whenever you change plugs, but my original went 160,000 miles.<BR>Try the Fiero Online Service Guide for the instructions, and don't forget to replace the distributor tube O-ring.  <BR>The only special tool I needed was a drift to knock out the roll pin that holds the distributor drive gear to the shaft.  That, plus some brake cleaner and real fine wet/dry sandpaper to clean the inner shaft with. <p>[This message has been edited by 2birds (edited 06-03-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||86SEFIERO||06-03-2000||10:40 PM||||thanks 2birds I will try that||||reg||1
Z||000005||Cooter||06-03-2000||11:03 PM||||Could also be one of the fuel pump relays. The pump should run for a few seconds when you first turn on the switch. If not, you have to crank the engine over until it builds enough oil pressure to kick the second relay in. Try swapping the relays around and see what happens- they are on the firewall in front of the air filter.||||reg||1
Z||000006||2birds||06-04-2000||11:27 AM||||Here's the link if you haven't found it yet.  I have it bookmarked.  Lots of good info here.<BR> <A HREF="http://members.xoom.com/fierov6/OSG/" TARGET=_blank>http://members.xoom.com/fierov6/OSG/</A> <p>[This message has been edited by 2birds (edited 06-04-2000).]||||reg||1
